      ],
      "icon": "structure"
    },
    {
      "id": "y7uytbop",
      "title": "Making the abstract concrete",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "eyopefy0",
          "layout": "2-1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "q3k6ts3v",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "Show the arithmetic, do not explain the concept"
              },
              {
                "id": "7u1jxq7f",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The instinct with an unfamiliar financial product is to explain it. We did the opposite and showed the sum, in the plainest numbers we could find:"
              },
              {
                "id": "kjisc86l",
                "kind": "table",
                "head": [
                  "",
                  ""
                ],
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "Property value",
                    "SAR 10,000,000"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Number of shares",
                    "10,000"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Price per share",
                    "SAR 1,000"
                  ],
                  [
                    "You invest SAR 10,000",
                    "You own 1% of the property, and 1% of its rent"
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "rk9nr29p",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "One worked example does what three paragraphs of definition cannot. A reader who follows that division has understood fractional ownership without ever being taught the term."
              },
              {
                "id": "fx90tyml",
                "kind": "beforeAfter",
                "before": "/uploads/1784470684570-Screenshot-2026-07-19-at-5.17.45-PM.webp",
                "after": "/uploads/1784470688740-Screenshot-2026-07-19-at-5.17.33-PM.webp",
                "caption": "Drag to compare.",
                "ratio": "wide",
                "fit": "natural"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "id": "bej1m84z",
                "kind": "image",
                "src": "/uploads/1784470797295-screencapture-hissatech-sa-en-tokenizati.webp",
                "alt": "",
