                "framed": true,
                "size": "column"
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "layers"
    },
    {
      "id": "hjttf2a9",
      "title": "The calculator",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "05bwzz0b",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "icukcvfw",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "Answering the question before it is asked"
              },
              {
                "id": "wt14k8p1",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "Every prospective investor arrives with the same question: what do I actually get back. The honest answer lives inside the app, behind a download. The calculator brings it forward onto the landing page, before anyone has committed to anything."
              },
              {
                "id": "4p8sif5z",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "It carries its own disclaimer, in plain language: the figures are estimates, they depend on the property and the rental market, and real results will differ. A calculator that overpromises does more damage than no calculator at all, especially inside a regulatory sandbox."
              },
              {
                "id": "j8unmtrx",
                "kind": "figma",
                "src": "https://embed.figma.com/proto/JjqwJWXsqnck4jh7csDr68/Hissatech-Website?node-id=7603-8256&p=f&viewport=201%2C-6813%2C0.55&page-id=6900%3A6055&starting-point-node-id=7603%3A8256&embed-host=share&footer=false",
                "caption": "Prototype is view-only.",
                "ratio": "1512 / 836",
                "scaling": "scale-down-width"
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "price"
    },
    {
      "id": "6bvk8olv",
      "title": "Trust as a design material",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "hru8qjdp",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "6j7byrb0",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "The credibility has to be on the page"
              },
              {
                "id": "gp7stt7v",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "For a product this unfamiliar, the trust signals are not decoration around the product. They are part of it, and each one is specific rather than generic:"
              },
              {
                "id": "i32h5lhk",
                "kind": "list",
                "items": [
                  "The Sharia ruling is named. Reviewed and approved by Sheikh Prof. Dr. Yousef bin Abdullah Al-Shubaily, with the certificate one tap away.",
                  "The regulator is named. The REGA sandbox, stated on the home page and explained in full on the about page.",
                  "The partners are named. Mada, Nafath, the Real Estate Authority, Arab National Bank, Lean.",
                  "The founders are named, with photographs and real biographies."
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "fswbt2p7",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "A badge that says \"secure\" persuades nobody. A scholar's name, a regulator's programme, and a bank you already use are checkable, and checkable is the only kind of trust that survives a serious investor."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "gnfnn76o",
      "title": "Arabic first",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "njd2b8vt",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "j6waew90",
                "kind": "heading",
                "level": 2,
                "text": "Built right to left, not flipped"
              },
              {
                "id": "leme7beq",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The product is Arabic first and reads right to left throughout: layout, navigation, forms, numerals, and the direction of every progress sequence. The English version is the mirror, not the original."
              },
              {
                "id": "noiqa6ly",
                "kind": "image",
                "src": "/uploads/1784471889006-Group-15.webp",
                "alt": "",
                "caption": "",
                "ratio": "wide",
                "fit": "natural",
                "framed": false,
                "size": "column"
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "design"
    },
    {
      "id": "45wl5lzv",
      "title": "Reflection",
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "tfsw4s6a",
          "layout": "1",
          "cells": [
            [
              {
                "id": "7dfg7ofm",
                "kind": "paragraph",
                "text": "The calculator was the most useful thing on the page and the last thing we built. It should have been the first, because it is the only element that answers the question everyone actually arrives with."
              },
              {
                "id": "h6r538ca",
                "kind": "figma",
